{"id":"5698","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5698_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为冬季天空中从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状鬃积雨云</span>中降下的气团阵雨。在该实例中，积雨云几乎完全冻结，其纤维状结构几乎延伸至云底便是证明。该云的卷云状纤维上部无法认定为积雨云性密卷云，因为它一直附着于母云积雨云。</p>\n<p>左侧远处也可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">鬃积雨云</span>单体。</p>\n<p>积雨云的扩散部分还形成了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>块。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，埃斯波","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"04 December 2011 1458 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.5"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5698_syn_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>图片拍摄于湿润海洋变性极地气团的西南气流中，地点是在距锢囚锋后部200公里的一个厚、宽且成熟的温带气旋的东南侧。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5698_upper_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>图片拍摄前1小时在拍摄地西北100公里处进行了探测，表明积雨云的纤维状顶部可达到约6000米的高度。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/radar/5698_radar_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>拍摄的云图在雷达拼图的中心位置，该区域中的阵雨沿盛行的西南风成行排列。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 芬兰气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5698_sat_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>照片拍摄之前40分钟的NOAA-18卫星图像（3、4和5信道综合）显示在其中间有一小簇积雨云。后一张照片中的云是同一云簇的一部分。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 芬兰气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4775_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-praecipitatio-incus-mamma-praecipitatio_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>这张照片显示了发展完好的对称性云砧的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">鬃积雨云细胞</span>（砧状附加特征）。砧状云下表面显示正在形成<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>。左边和后面是另一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">更近期的细胞</span>。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处，这两个细胞都在产生降水。</p>\n<p>在左边缘是另一个被确定为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>的积云状细胞。这个细胞即将过渡到秃积雨云。在许多区域可以看到更多处于不同发展阶段的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>。</p>\n<p>积雨云被称为“云工厂”，可能产生<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>、高层云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>的云块。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Mustafa Hayri Ayvaz","location":"土耳其伊斯坦布尔","latitude":"纬度: 40° 52' 50'' N","longitude":"经度: 29° 12' 39'' E","date":"04 May 2016 1659 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 6, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.5"}]}]}